  "summary_en": "Japan's Road Vehicles Act (1951, current revision effective 2026-04-01) governs vehicle registration, safety standards, inspection, maintenance and certification. Article 41 includes \"automatic operation devices\" (自動運行装置) among regulated vehicle equipment, giving a legal basis for certifying autonomous driving systems.",
  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
   "Vehicles must be registered and meet MLIT safety and environmental standards (保安基準) before operation.",
   "Article 41(1)(20) and (2) define and regulate 'automatic operation devices' replacing the driver's cognition, judgment and operation, usable under MLIT-set conditions and with operating-state recording.",
   "Periodic and new vehicle inspections, certification and designated maintenance operators ensure compliance.",
   "Penalties and administrative oversight by the Minister of Land, Infrastructure, Transport and Tourism."
  ],
